---
permalink: /posts/
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
description: Notes on software, infrastructure, and things I have had to work out the hard way.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<h1>Writing</h1>

<p class="lede">
  Notes on software, infrastructure, and things I've had to work out the hard way.
</p>

{%- set posts = collections.posts | byNewest %}
{%- if posts.length %}
<ul class="post-list">
  {%- for post in posts %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    {%- if post.data.description %}
    <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<p>Nothing published yet. When I write something up, it will appear here.</p>
{%- endif %}
